[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5463.03, "timestamp": "01:31:03", "text": "把我从桌子上割下来。什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5469.99, "timestamp": "01:31:09", "text": "你可以做到。我相信你。你得到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5472.55, "timestamp": "01:31:12", "text": "手榴弹。使用你的手榴弹。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5477.11, "timestamp": "01:31:17", "text": "等等，你死了吗？死。是的，我死了。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5481.59, "timestamp": "01:31:21", "text": "不，他把我从桌子底下拽了过去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5483.75, "timestamp": "01:31:23", "text": "非常确定如何"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5486.149, "timestamp": "01:31:26", "text": "我当时就像在躲藏那张桌子一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5488.79, "timestamp": "01:31:28", "text": "我会没事的。他没办法把我弄到下面去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5506.55, "timestamp": "01:31:46", "text": "使用激光时务必小心。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5513.83, "timestamp": "01:31:53", "text": "我就是一堵墙。我就是一堵墙。我真是太糟糕了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5518.79, "timestamp": "01:31:58", "text": "哦，不。你接受得很好。好的。再见，"}]